sequenceDiagram
    participant SPOC as Activity SPOC
    participant UI as Web Interface
    participant API as API Gateway
    participant WS as Workflow Service
    participant US as User Service
    participant NS as Notification Service
    participant AS as Audit Service
    participant DB as Database
    participant MOBILE as Mobile App
    participant FS as Field Staff
    
    Note over SPOC,FS: Health Facility Assignment by Activity SPOC
    
    SPOC->>UI: Login and view assignment dashboard
    UI->>API: GET /api/v1/activity-assignments?assigned-to-me=true&status=active
    API->>WS: Fetch active assignments for SPOC
    WS->>DB: Query assignments with facility counts
    DB-->>WS: Return assignments with statistics
    WS-->>API: Return assignment data
    API-->>UI: Display assignment dashboard
    UI-->>SPOC: Show assigned field plans and progress
    
    SPOC->>UI: Click on specific field plan assignment
    UI->>API: GET /api/v1/field-plans/{id}/facilities?activity={activityId}&assigned-to-me=true
    API->>WS: Get facilities for activity assignment
    WS->>DB: Query facility activities for field plan and activity
    DB-->>WS: Return facility list with assignment status
    WS-->>API: Return facilities
    API-->>UI: Display facility assignment interface
    UI-->>SPOC: Show facilities with assignment status
    
    Note over SPOC,UI: SPOC sees unassigned facilities that need team assignment
    
    SPOC->>UI: Check team members availability
    UI->>API: GET /api/v1/teams/my-team?activity={activityId}
    API->>US: Get team members for activity
    US->>DB: Query users in SPOC's team with required skills
    DB-->>US: Return team member list
    US-->>API: Return team data
    API-->>UI: Display team members
    UI-->>SPOC: Show available field staff
    
    alt No Team Members Available
        SPOC->>UI: Click "Add Team Members"
        UI->>API: GET /api/v1/users/search?role=FIELD_STAFF&organization={orgId}
        API->>US: Search for field staff
        US->>DB: Query available field staff
        DB-->>US: Return potential team members
        US-->>API: Return user list
        API-->>UI: Display available staff
        
        SPOC->>UI: Select staff members to add to team
        UI->>API: POST /api/v1/teams/add-members
        API->>US: Add members to SPOC's team
        US->>DB: Create team associations
        DB-->>US: Team updated
        
        US->>NS: Send team invitation notifications
        NS->>NS: Send emails to new team members
        
        US-->>API: Team members added
        API-->>UI: Show success message
        UI-->>SPOC: "Team members added successfully"
    end
    
    SPOC->>UI: Assign facilities to field staff
    Note over SPOC,UI: Can assign individual or bulk assign
    
    alt Individual Assignment
        SPOC->>UI: Select facility and field staff member
        UI->>API: POST /api/v1/facility-activities/{id}/assign-user
        API->>WS: Assign facility to field staff
        
        WS->>DB: Check if facility can be assigned
        alt Facility Already Assigned
            DB-->>WS: Return assignment conflict
            WS-->>API: Return error
            API-->>UI: Show error message
            UI-->>SPOC: "Facility already assigned to another user"
        else Assignment Valid
            WS->>DB: Update facility_activities record
            WS->>DB: Set assigned_user and status
            DB-->>WS: Assignment completed
            
            WS->>WS: Check activation conditions
            Note over WS: Evaluate if facility should be activated
            
            alt Conditions Met for Activation
                WS->>DB: Update status to ACTIVE
                WS->>DB: Set activated_at timestamp
                DB-->>WS: Status updated to ACTIVE
                
                WS->>NS: Send activation notification to field staff
                NS->>MOBILE: Send push notification
                MOBILE-->>FS: Show "New facility activated"
                
            else Conditions Not Met
                Note over WS: Status remains SCHEDULED
                WS->>NS: Send assignment notification (not activated yet)
                NS->>MOBILE: Send assignment notification
                MOBILE-->>FS: Show "Facility assigned, waiting for activation"
            end
            
            WS-->>API: Assignment successful
            API-->>UI: Return success response
            UI-->>SPOC: Show assignment confirmation
        end
        
    else Bulk Assignment via Excel
        SPOC->>UI: Click "Bulk Assign Facilities"
        UI->>API: GET /api/v1/facility-activities/assignment-template?field-plan={id}
        API->>WS: Generate assignment template
        WS->>DB: Get facilities and team members
        DB-->>WS: Return data for template
        WS->>FS: Generate Excel with dropdowns
        FS-->>WS: Return template URL
        WS-->>API: Return template download link
        API-->>UI: Download template
        UI-->>SPOC: Template downloaded
        
        SPOC->>SPOC: Fill assignment data in Excel
        SPOC->>UI: Upload completed assignment file
        
        UI->>API: POST /api/v1/facility-activities/bulk-assign (multipart)
        API->>WS: Process bulk assignment
        WS->>FS: Validate uploaded file
        
        alt Invalid File Format
            FS-->>WS: Return format error
            WS-->>API: Return validation error
            API-->>UI: Show error message
            UI-->>SPOC: "Invalid file format"
        else Valid File
            FS->>FS: Parse assignment data
            FS-->>WS: Return assignment list
            
            WS->>DB: Begin transaction
            
            loop For each facility assignment
                WS->>DB: Validate assignment (no conflicts)
                alt Assignment Conflict
                    DB-->>WS: Return conflict error
                    WS->>WS: Add to error list
                else Valid Assignment
                    WS->>DB: Update facility_activities record
                    DB-->>WS: Assignment updated
                    
                    WS->>WS: Check activation conditions
                    alt Conditions Met
                        WS->>DB: Set status to ACTIVE
                        WS->>DB: Set activated_at timestamp
                        DB-->>WS: Status activated
                    else Conditions Not Met
                        Note over WS: Remains SCHEDULED
                    end
                end
            end
            
            alt Assignment Errors Found
                WS->>DB: Rollback transaction
                WS->>FS: Generate error report
                FS-->>WS: Return error report URL
                WS-->>API: Return bulk assignment errors
                API-->>UI: Show error summary with download link
                UI-->>SPOC: "Some assignments failed, download error report"
                
            else All Assignments Successful
                WS->>DB: Commit transaction
                DB-->>WS: All assignments committed
                
                WS->>AS: Log bulk assignment audit
                AS->>DB: Store audit record
                DB-->>AS: Audit logged
                
                Note over WS,NS: Send notifications asynchronously
                loop For each assigned field staff
                    WS->>NS: Queue notification for field staff
                    NS->>MOBILE: Send push notification
                    MOBILE-->>FS: Show facility assignment notification
                end
                
                WS-->>API: Bulk assignment successful
                API-->>UI: Return success summary
                UI-->>SPOC: Show "X facilities assigned successfully"
            end
        end
    end
    
    Note over SPOC,FS: Field Staff receives notifications
    
    FS->>MOBILE: Open mobile app
    MOBILE->>API: GET /api/v1/facility-activities?assigned-to-me=true&status=active
    API->>WS: Get active facilities for field staff
    WS->>DB: Query active facility assignments
    DB-->>WS: Return active facilities
    WS-->>API: Return facility list
    API-->>MOBILE: Display assigned facilities
    MOBILE-->>FS: Show active facilities ready for work
    
    SPOC->>UI: Monitor assignment progress
    UI->>API: GET /api/v1/field-plans/{id}/progress?activity={activityId}
    API->>WS: Get assignment and progress statistics
    WS->>DB: Query facility assignment status counts
    DB-->>WS: Return progress data
    WS-->>API: Return progress statistics
    API-->>UI: Display progress dashboard
    UI-->>SPOC: Show assignment progress (Assigned: X, Active: Y, Completed: Z)
    
    Note over SPOC,FS: Facilities assigned and field staff can begin work 